  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-03-23T02:28:43.468Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've been playing on standalone Quest 2 for about 3 years since 2022 and recently upgraded to PCVR in January. A problem that I've been facing every now and then is that I would visit a world that's either new or updated and can be a world regularly used by me and my friends, but then, my friends who are still on Quest 2 and maybe Quest 3 will find that the world is too laggy for them or that their frames will drop. I think worlds should have some kind of indicator on the menu that will give an idea of what to expect performance wise.\n\nOn PCVR, performance issues don't happen often and it can be really easy to not be aware of how a world might be like on Quest.",
